Fixes https://github.com/microsoft/vscode-internalbacklog/issues/8824

This change:

- shares the edit auto-approval defaults between the workbench and Agent Host;
- forwards `chat.tools.edits.autoApprove` through the declarative Agent Host configuration mapping;
- preserves mandatory confirmation for lifecycle-hook files regardless of user configuration;
- applies filesystem-appropriate casing when matching protected paths and checks case-normalized real paths;
- adds regression coverage for merged protections, configured rules, mandatory hook rules, and mixed-case paths.

Validation:

- `npm run transpile-client`
- `./scripts/test.sh --run src/vs/platform/agentHost/test/node/sessionPermissions.test.ts --run src/vs/platform/agentHost/test/electron-browser/remoteAgentHostProtocolClient.test.ts` (120 passing)
- `npm run typecheck-client`

(Written by Copilot)
